# RC1-255: eval-runs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Run records are committed so
# the trend view can attribute a score change to a model or prompt version —
# see agent-evals/docs/trend.md. CI never writes this log, so everything in it
# is a measurement someone chose to take.
